{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>If you do well.</b> Improve yourself and strive to be acceptable as well." "<b>Lifting up.</b> The height of excellence and exaltation <b>lies at your door</b> and is ready to be yours." "<b>And if you do not do well, sin crouches at the door.</b> So too the sin lies ready before you, for you will add transgression upon your sin — such is the way of the evil inclination." "<b>And its desire is toward you.</b> For you turn toward it to fulfill its desires, as they said of blessed memory (Sukkah 52b): a person's inclination overpowers him every day." "<b>And you shall rule over it.</b> It is in your power to prevail over it through the image of Elohim, as they said (Sukkah 52b): were it not that the Holy One, blessed be He, helps him, he could not withstand it, as it says (Psalms 37:33): יהוה will not forsake him in his hand."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:02.361521566Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}